            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Bank of America Plans Shake-Up of Senior Leadership Ranks",
            "description": "Bank of America\u00a0is planning a shake-up of its senior leadership ranks in a move that narrows the slate of leaders who could one day succeed long-time CEO Brian Moynihan. The discussion involves expanding the role of\u00a0Jim DeMare, who runs the firm's trading business, along with promotions for other senior leaders, according to people with knowledge of the matter. Sridhar Natarajan has more on \"Bloomberg The Close.\"",
